{%- comment -%}
  Fiche produit MOBILE – haut de page (prototype « platinumshop-pdp-mobile-b ») :
  galerie plein écran (compteur n / N) + vignettes, puis carte titre / prix / ticket coupon.
  Données réelles : photos du produit, titre, prix de la variante, note (métachamps d'avis),
  coupon : code et % des réglages du thème « Coupon (mobile) » ; la réduction s'applique à toute la commande
  (vérifié sur le panier : pas de minimum ni de plafond).
  Affiché seulement en mobile (assets/pdp-mobile.css), le desktop garde la fiche Xtra.
  Les variantes, le panier et les apps restent ceux du thème (formulaire existant).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign pm_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign pm_price = pm_variant.price
  assign pm_compare = pm_variant.compare_at_price | default: 0

  # Coupon : réglages du thème « Coupon (mobile) » (code et % de la réduction Shopify), plus de valeurs en dur.
  assign pm_coupon_code = settings.mobile_coupon_code | strip
  assign pm_coupon_percent = settings.mobile_coupon_percent | default: 20

  # Livraison gratuite : seuil des réglages du thème (en euros, devise de la boutique). Dans une autre devise, Shopify
  # compare au seuil converti au taux (vérifié : 48 CHF gratuit, 46 CHF payant pour 50 €) : assets/pdp-mobile.js le
  # convertit et l'arrondit au-dessus (pm_ship_threshold = 0 ici), comme le tiroir panier.
  assign pm_ship_base = 0
  if settings.enable_free_shipping and settings.free_shipping_amount != blank
    assign pm_ship_base = settings.free_shipping_amount | replace: ',', '.' | times: 100 | round
  endif
  assign pm_ship_threshold = 0
  if cart.currency.iso_code == shop.currency
    assign pm_ship_threshold = pm_ship_base
  endif

  assign pm_rating = 0
  assign pm_rating_count = 0
  # Note de l'app Ali Reviews, comme les cartes (snippets/mshein-card.liquid) : affichée tout de suite, aussi quand la
  # fiche est ouverte sur place (assets/mobile-pdp-layer.js, sans le JSON-LD de la page).
  assign pm_ali = product.metafields.alireviews.seo_rating_review_key_script | append: '' | strip_newlines | remove: ' '
  if pm_ali contains '"ratingValue":"' and pm_ali contains '"reviewCount":"'
    assign pm_rating = pm_ali | split: '"ratingValue":"' | last | split: '"' | first | times: 1.0
    assign pm_rating_count = pm_ali | split: '"reviewCount":"' | last | split: '"' | first
  elsif product.metafields.syncer.reviews
    assign pm_rating = product.metafields.syncer.reviews.value.cumulative_rating
    assign pm_rating_count = product.metafields.syncer.reviews.value.total_reviews
  elsif product.metafields.reviews.rating
    assign pm_rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating
    assign pm_rating_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count
  endif
  assign pm_rating_count = pm_rating_count | plus: 0
  assign pm_stars_width = pm_rating | times: 20.0

  assign pm_media_count = 0
  for media in product.media
    if media.preview_image
      assign pm_media_count = pm_media_count | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
-%}
{%- comment -%} Code de la devise après les prix quand « $ » est ambigu (« $94.00 CAD »). {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture mm_cur -%}{% render 'mobile-money-suffix' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- comment -%} Caché par défaut (desktop) ; assets/pdp-mobile.css, chargé seulement en mobile, l'affiche. {%- endcomment -%}
<style>.pdp-m{display:none}</style>
<div class="pdp-m" data-pdp-mobile data-coupon-code="{{ pm_coupon_code }}">
  <script type="application/json" data-pdp-variants>
    [{%- for v in product.variants -%}{"id":{{ v.id }},"price":{{ v.price }},"compare":{{ v.compare_at_price | default: 0 }},"media":{{ v.featured_media.id | default: 0 }},"available":{{ v.available }},"inv":{% if v.inventory_management == 'shopify' and v.inventory_policy == 'deny' %}{{ v.inventory_quantity }}{% else %}null{% endif %},"options":{{ v.options | json }},"title":{{ v.title | json }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{%- endfor -%}]
  </script>

  {%- comment -%}
    En-tête de la fiche au style SHEIN (remplace l'en-tête du site sur la fiche mobile, assets/pdp-mobile.css) : retour,
    recherche (nom du produit), panier (ouvre le tiroir du site, compteur commun .mobile-home-cart-count), partager, ⋯ ;
    onglets « Articolo / Recensioni / Consigliati » une fois les photos passées (assets/pdp-mobile.js).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign hd_track = pages['traccia-ordine']
    assign hd_help = pages['contatti']
    assign hd_wishlist = pages['wishlist']
    assign hd_share_text = 'mobile_pdp_hd.share_text' | t: shop: shop.name
  -%}
  <header class="pdp-m__hd" data-pdp-hd>
    <div class="pdp-m__hdr">
      <a class="pdp-m__hi" href="{{ routes.root_url }}" data-pdp-back aria-label="{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.back' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 5-7 7 7 7"/></svg></a>
      {%- comment -%} Vrai champ, comme sur l'accueil : le panneau de recherche du site s'ouvre au toucher (assets/mobile-search.js, data-mobile-search-extra). {%- endcomment -%}
      <form class="pdp-m__hsrch" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search" data-mobile-search-extra>
        <input type="search" name="q" placeholder="{{ 'search.search_form.placeholder' | t }}" aria-label="{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.search' | t }}" autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit" aria-label="{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.search' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg></button>
      </form>
      <a class="pdp-m__hi" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" data-pdp-cart aria-label="{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.cart' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 6h15l-1.5 9h-12z"/><path d="M6 6 5 2H2"/><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1.5"/></svg><span class="mobile-home-cart-count pdp-m__hcount"{% if cart.item_count == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ cart.item_count }}</span></a>
      <button class="pdp-m__hi" type="button" data-pdp-share-open aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.share' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 15V3M7 8l5-5 5 5M5 13v7h14v-7"/></svg></button>
      <button class="pdp-m__hi" type="button" data-pdp-menu-open aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.more' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.7"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.7"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.7"/></svg></button>
    </div>
    <nav class="pdp-m__stabs" data-pdp-stabs aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}">
      <button type="button" class="is-on" data-pdp-stab="top">{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.tab_item' | t }}</button>
      <button type="button" data-pdp-stab="pdp-reviews">{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.tab_reviews' | t }}</button>
      <button type="button" data-pdp-stab="pdp-related">{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.tab_rec' | t }}</button>
    </nav>
    <nav class="pdp-m__hmenu" role="menu" data-pdp-menu hidden>
      <a role="menuitem" href="{{ routes.root_url }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 11 12 4l9 7M5 10v10h5v-6h4v6h5V10"/></svg>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.menu_home' | t }}</a>
      {%- if hd_wishlist != empty -%}<a role="menuitem" href="{{ hd_wishlist.url }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 10c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z"/></svg>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.menu_wishlist' | t }}</a>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if hd_track != empty -%}<a role="menuitem" href="{{ hd_track.url }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 5h13v11H1zM14 9h4l3 3v4h-7"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="18" r="2"/></svg>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.menu_track' | t }}</a>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if hd_help != empty -%}<a role="menuitem" href="{{ hd_help.url }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 13v-1a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v1"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/><rect x="17" y="13" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/><path d="M19 19c0 1.5-2 2-5 2"/></svg>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.menu_help' | t }}</a>{%- endif -%}
    </nav>
  </header>

  {%- comment -%} Partager, comme SHEIN : WhatsApp, Messaggi, Instagram (partage du téléphone), copier le lien, image, autres. {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pdp-m__share" data-pdp-share data-url="{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}" data-text="{{ hd_share_text | escape }}" data-image="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}" data-copied="{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.copied' | t | escape }}" hidden>
    <div class="pdp-m__share-in" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="pdp-share-title">
      <button class="pdp-m__share-x" type="button" data-pdp-share-close aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.close' | t }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button>
      <p class="pdp-m__share-t" id="pdp-share-title">{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.share_title' | t }}</p>
      <p class="pdp-m__share-s">{{ hd_share_text }}</p>
      <div class="pdp-m__share-g">
        <button type="button" data-share="whatsapp"><span class="is-wa"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15l-1.4 5 5.1-1.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2zm0 18.2a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-4.2-1.2l-.3-.2-3 .8.8-2.9-.2-.3A8.2 8.2 0 1 1 12 20.2zm4.5-6.1c-.2-.1-1.5-.7-1.7-.8-.2-.1-.4-.1-.6.1l-.8 1c-.1.2-.3.2-.5.1a6.7 6.7 0 0 1-3.3-2.9c-.2-.4.2-.4.7-1.3.1-.2 0-.3 0-.4l-.8-1.8c-.2-.5-.4-.4-.6-.4h-.5a1 1 0 0 0-.7.3 3 3 0 0 0-.9 2.2 5.1 5.1 0 0 0 1.1 2.7 11.6 11.6 0 0 0 4.4 3.9c1.6.7 2.3.8 3.1.6.5-.1 1.5-.6 1.7-1.2.2-.6.2-1.1.1-1.2l-.5-.4z"/></svg></span>WhatsApp</button>
        <button type="button" data-share="sms"><span class="is-msg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 3C6.5 3 2 6.8 2 11.5c0 2.6 1.4 4.9 3.6 6.5L5 21.5l3.9-2.2c1 .3 2 .4 3.1.4 5.5 0 10-3.8 10-8.5S17.5 3 12 3zm-4 9.7a1.2 1.2 0 1 1 0-2.4 1.2 1.2 0 0 1 0 2.4zm4 0a1.2 1.2 0 1 1 0-2.4 1.2 1.2 0 0 1 0 2.4zm4 0a1.2 1.2 0 1 1 0-2.4 1.2 1.2 0 0 1 0 2.4z"/></svg></span>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.share_sms' | t }}</button>
        <button type="button" data-share="native"><span class="is-ig"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.3" cy="6.7" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>Instagram</button>
        <button type="button" data-share="copy"><span class="is-grey"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 14a4 4 0 0 0 5.7 0l3-3a4 4 0 0 0-5.7-5.7l-1 1"/><path d="M14 10a4 4 0 0 0-5.7 0l-3 3a4 4 0 0 0 5.7 5.7l1-1"/></svg></span>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.share_copy' | t }}</button>
        <button type="button" data-share="image"><span class="is-grey"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 4v11M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 19h14"/></svg></span>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.share_save' | t }}</button>
        <button type="button" data-share="native"><span class="is-grey"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.8"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.8"/></svg></span>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.share_more' | t }}</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pdp-m__toast" data-pdp-toast role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

  {%- if pm_media_count > 0 -%}
    <section class="pdp-m__gal" aria-roledescription="{{ 'mobile.pdp.carousel' | t }}" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.gallery' | t }}">
      <div class="pdp-m__slides" data-pdp-slides>
        {%- assign pm_index = 0 -%}
        {%- for media in product.media -%}
          {%- if media.preview_image -%}
            {%- assign pm_index = pm_index | plus: 1 -%}
            <div class="pdp-m__sl" data-media-id="{{ media.id }}">
              <img
                src="{{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 750 }}"
                srcset="{{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 375 }} 375w, {{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w, {{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w"
                sizes="100vw"
                width="{{ media.preview_image.width }}"
                height="{{ media.preview_image.height }}"
                alt="{{ media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
                {% if pm_index == 1 %}fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}
              >
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      <span class="pdp-m__cnt" data-pdp-count>1 / {{ pm_media_count }}</span>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Marques officielles (Nike, Adidas…) : bande « Negozio Ufficiale del Marchio » (sa fenêtre d'information) et badges
    Official Store / Star seller / Brand Official, comme avant sous les photos. assets/pdp-mobile.js y déplace ceux que
    l'ancien bloc produit affiche (snippets/prodducts--brand-popap.liquid, badge--brand-products.liquid) : mêmes textes
    traduits, même fenêtre, sans les dupliquer.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Autres marques de chaussures (Skechers, Li-Ning, Xti… : snippets/shoe-brand.liquid, même liste que les cartes) : la
    même bande, la même fenêtre et les mêmes badges, rendus ici (l'ancien bloc produit ne les rend que pour les marques
    officielles, et le desktop reste inchangé).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign pm_brand_title = product.title | downcase
    assign pm_official = false
    assign pm_official_brands = 'jordan, nike, adidas, puma, reebok, new balance, onemix, asics' | split: ', '
    for pm_official_brand in pm_official_brands
      if pm_brand_title contains pm_official_brand
        assign pm_official = true
        break
      endif
    endfor
    assign pm_shoe_brand = ''
    unless pm_official
      capture pm_shoe_brand
        render 'shoe-brand', product: product
      endcapture
      assign pm_shoe_brand = pm_shoe_brand | strip
    endunless
  -%}
  <div class="pdp-m__brand" data-pdp-brand hidden>
    {%- if pm_shoe_brand != blank -%}
      {%- render 'prodducts--brand-popap', product: product, shoe_brand: pm_shoe_brand -%}
      {%- render 'badge--brand-products', product: product, shoe_brand: pm_shoe_brand -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Bande avantages sous les photos (prototype SHEIN) : la même que sous la bannière de l'accueil. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- render 'mshein-perks' -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Carte prix au style SHEIN : prix, -%, prix barré ; prix avec le coupon ; bande coupon (« Riscuoti » applique le code) ;
    titre sur 2 lignes (flèche pour tout lire) avec la note à droite (★ 4,7 / (19), lien vers les avis).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture pm_star -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7L12 17.3 5.8 21l1.6-7L2 9.2l7.1-.6z"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}
  <section class="pdp-m__card pdp-m__price-card">
    <div class="pdp-m__prow">
      {%- liquid
        # Centimes plus petits, comme SHEIN (« €117,79 » avec « ,79 » réduit) ; assets/pdp-mobile.js découpe de même.
        assign pm_price_txt = pm_price | money | strip_html
        assign pm_price_tail = pm_price_txt | slice: -3, 3
        assign pm_price_sep = pm_price_tail | slice: 0, 1
        assign pm_price_head = pm_price_txt.size | minus: 3
      -%}
      <span class="pdp-m__price{% if pm_compare > pm_price %} is-sale{% endif %}" data-pdp-price>
        {%- if pm_price_sep == ',' or pm_price_sep == '.' -%}
          {{ pm_price_txt | slice: 0, pm_price_head }}<small>{{ pm_price_tail }}</small>
        {%- else -%}
          {{ pm_price_txt }}
        {%- endif -%}
        {{- mm_cur -}}
      </span>
      {%- liquid
        assign pm_save = 0
        if pm_compare > pm_price
          assign pm_save = pm_compare | minus: pm_price | times: 100 | divided_by: pm_compare
        endif
      -%}
      <span class="pdp-m__save" data-pdp-save{% unless pm_save > 0 %} hidden{% endunless %}>-{{ pm_save }}%</span>
      <span class="pdp-m__old" data-pdp-old{% unless pm_compare > pm_price %} hidden{% endunless %}>{{ pm_compare | money }}{{ mm_cur }}</span>
    </div>
    {%- if pm_coupon_code != blank -%}
      {%- comment -%} Prix avec le coupon (réduction Shopify sur toute la commande), mis à jour à chaque variante (assets/pdp-mobile.js). {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign pm_with_coupon = 100 | minus: pm_coupon_percent | times: pm_price | divided_by: 100.0 | round
        assign pm_with_coupon_money = pm_with_coupon | money | append: mm_cur
        assign pm_with_coupon_tpl = 'mobile.pdp.with_coupon' | t: percent: pm_coupon_percent, price: '__PRICE__'
      -%}
      <p class="pdp-m__wc" data-pdp-with-coupon data-percent="{{ pm_coupon_percent }}" data-template="{{ pm_with_coupon_tpl | escape }}">{{ pm_with_coupon_tpl | replace: '__PRICE__', pm_with_coupon_money }}</p>
      <div class="pdp-m__cpn">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8a2 2 0 0 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 1 0 4v2h18v-2a2 2 0 0 1 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4V6H3z"/><path d="M14 6v12" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/></svg>
        <span>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.coupon_band' | t: percent: pm_coupon_percent, code: pm_coupon_code }}</span>
        <button class="pdp-m__claim" type="button" data-pdp-claim>{{ 'mobile.pdp.claim' | t }}</button>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="pdp-m__trow">
      <div class="pdp-m__title" role="heading" aria-level="1" data-pdp-title>{{ product.title | escape }}</div>
      <button class="pdp-m__tmore" type="button" data-pdp-title-more aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.show_all' | t | escape }}" aria-expanded="false" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button>
      <a href="#pdp-reviews" class="pdp-m__rate" data-pdp-goto-reviews data-star="{{ pm_star | escape }}">
        {%- if pm_rating_count > 0 -%}
          {%- assign pm_rating_shown = pm_rating | round: 1 | append: '' -%}
          {%- unless pm_rating_shown contains '.' -%}{%- assign pm_rating_shown = pm_rating_shown | append: '.0' -%}{%- endunless -%}
          {%- if request.locale.iso_code != 'en' -%}{%- assign pm_rating_shown = pm_rating_shown | replace: '.', ',' -%}{%- endif -%}
          <b aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.rating_out_of' | t: rating: pm_rating_shown }}">{{ pm_star }}{{ pm_rating_shown }}</b><small>({{ pm_rating_count }})</small>
        {%- else -%}
          <b>{{ pm_star }}</b><small>{{ 'mobile.pdp.reviews_title_short' | t }}</small>
        {%- endif -%}
      </a>
      {%- if pm_rating_count == 0 -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Note réelle de l'app d'avis (Ali Reviews), déjà écrite dans le <head> par l'app SEO (JSON-LD aggregateRating) :
          on l'affiche tout de suite, sans attendre que le bloc de l'app se charge (plusieurs secondes sur mobile).
          Sans note dans la page, la ligne reste « Recensioni » et assets/pdp-mobile.js la remplit comme avant.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <script>
          (function () {
            var link = document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;
            var title = {{ product.title | json }};
            var found = null;
            var visit = function (node) {
              if (!node || typeof node !== 'object' || found) return;
              if (Array.isArray(node)) { node.forEach(visit); return; }
              if (node.aggregateRating && (!node.name || node.name === title)) found = node.aggregateRating;
              if (node['@graph']) visit(node['@graph']);
            };
            document.querySelectorAll('script[type="application/ld+json"]').forEach(function (script) {
              try { visit(JSON.parse(script.textContent)); } catch (error) { /* JSON-LD invalide d'une autre app */ }
            });
            var value = found ? parseFloat(found.ratingValue) : NaN;
            var count = found ? parseInt(found.reviewCount || found.ratingCount, 10) : 0;
            if (!link || isNaN(value) || !(count > 0)) return;
            var shown = value.toLocaleString(document.documentElement.lang || 'it', { minimumFractionDigits: 1, maximumFractionDigits: 1 });
            var label = {{ 'mobile.pdp.rating_out_of' | t: rating: '__R__' | json }}.replace('__R__', shown);
            link.innerHTML = '<b>' + link.getAttribute('data-star') + shown + '</b><small>(' + count + ')</small>';
            link.firstChild.setAttribute('aria-label', label);
          })();
        </script>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%}
    4. Vantaggi esclusivi : retirée de l'écran (prototype SHEIN : bande coupon et bande avantages à la place).
    Ses fenêtres restent, ouvertes par les cartes « Protezioni » (8) et « Garanzia Ordine » (9) et la feuille des conditions.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- render 'pdp-mobile-protect' -%}
  {%- render 'pdp-mobile-order' -%}
  {%- if pm_coupon_code != blank -%}
    {%- render 'pdp-mobile-terms', code: pm_coupon_code, percent: pm_coupon_percent -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} 5. Options réelles du produit : un choix ici coche l'option correspondante du formulaire du thème. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
    <section class="pdp-m__card" id="pdp-variants" data-pdp-options>
      {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign option_index = forloop.index0
          assign option_name = option.name | downcase
          assign is_color = false
          if option_name contains 'color' or option_name contains 'colour' or option_name contains 'colore'
            assign is_color = true
          endif
          assign is_ship = false
          if option_name contains 'ship' or option_name contains 'spedit' or option_name contains 'spedizion' or option_name contains 'country' or option_name contains 'paese'
            assign is_ship = true
          endif
          assign is_size = false
          case option_name
            when 'color', 'colour'
              assign option_label = 'mobile.pdp.color' | t
            when 'size'
              assign option_label = 'mobile.pdp.size' | t
              assign is_size = true
            else
              assign option_label = option.name
          endcase
          if is_ship
            assign option_label = 'mobile.pdp.ships_from' | t
          endif
          # Toutes les options de taille (« Size », « Taglia », « Misura della scarpa », « Dimensione »…) ont le sélecteur
          # de taille (assets/pdp-mobile.js) ; « Dimensione » peut aussi être une dimension d'objet : son libellé et son
          # guide ne deviennent « Taglia » que si le script y trouve de vraies tailles (plages kg / cm).
          assign is_dimension = false
          unless is_color or is_ship
            if option_name contains 'size' or option_name contains 'taglia' or option_name contains 'misura' or option_name contains 'dimension'
              assign is_size = true
            endif
            # Noms anglais (« Shoe Size »…) : libellé traduit, même sur la boutique italienne.
            if option_name contains 'size'
              assign option_label = 'mobile.pdp.size' | t
            endif
            if option_name contains 'dimension'
              assign is_dimension = true
            endif
          endunless
          # Noms d'options saisis en italien dans les produits (« Colore », « Misura della scarpa », « Spedizioni da ») :
          # dans les autres langues, libellé traduit du thème. En italien, le nom du produit reste affiché tel quel.
          if request.locale.iso_code != 'it'
            if is_color
              assign option_label = 'mobile.pdp.color' | t
            elsif option_name contains 'misura' or option_name contains 'taglia'
              assign option_label = 'mobile.pdp.size' | t
            elsif option_name contains 'spedizion'
              assign option_label = 'mobile.pdp.ships_from' | t
            endif
          endif
        -%}
        {%- if is_ship and option.values.size == 1 -%}
          {%- comment -%} Une seule origine d'expédition : rien à choisir, simple ligne « 📍 Spedito da : … » (prototype SHEIN),
             le prix de la variante se place à sa droite (assets/pdp-mobile.js). {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="pdp-m__opt pdp-m__opt--from" data-option-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
            <div class="pdp-m__from"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-6.2 7-11.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg><span>{{ option_label }}:</span> <b data-pdp-option-name>{{ option.values.first | escape }}</b></div>
          </div>
          {%- continue -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="pdp-m__opt" data-option-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"{% if is_size %} data-pdp-size data-size-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.size' | t | escape }}"{% endif %}>
          <div class="pdp-m__olab">
            <span><span data-pdp-option-label>{{ option_label }}</span>: <b data-pdp-option-name>{{ option.selected_value }}</b>
              {%- if is_color and option.values.size > 1 -%}
                {%- comment -%} Nombre réel de couleurs (comme l'ajout rapide). {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign pm_colors_text = 'mobile.js.qa_colors_count' | t
                  assign pm_colors_text = pm_colors_text | replace: '{count}', option.values.size
                -%}
                <span class="pdp-m__ccount">{{ pm_colors_text }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
            {%- if is_color and option.values.size > 4 -%}
              {%- comment -%} Couleurs cachées dans la rangée défilante : « Vedi tutti » les montre toutes en grille (assets/pdp-mobile.js). {%- endcomment -%}
              <button type="button" data-pdp-colors-all aria-expanded="false" data-less="{{ 'mobile.js.show_less' | t | escape }}"><span>{{ 'mobile.js.qa_see_all' | t }}</span><svg class="pdp-m__cv" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if is_size -%}
              <button type="button" data-pdp-size-guide{% if is_dimension %} hidden{% endif %}><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="6" rx="1.5"/><path d="M7 9v3M11 9v2M15 9v3M19 9v2"/></svg>{{ 'mobile.pdp.size_guide' | t }}</button>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          {%- if is_color -%}
            <div class="pdp-m__sw" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ option_label }}">
              {%- for value in option.values -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign swatch_image = blank
                  for v in product.variants
                    if v.options[option_index] == value and v.featured_media
                      assign swatch_image = v.featured_media.preview_image
                      break
                    endif
                  endfor
                -%}
                <button type="button" class="pdp-m__swb" role="radio" aria-checked="{% if value == option.selected_value %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-value="{{ value | escape }}">
                  <span class="pdp-m__im">
                    {%- if swatch_image != blank -%}
                      <img src="{{ swatch_image | image_url: width: 152, height: 152, crop: 'center' }}" width="76" height="76" alt="" loading="lazy">
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                  <span class="pdp-m__n">{{ value | escape }}</span>
                </button>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="pdp-m__sz{% if is_ship %} pdp-m__sz--ship{% endif %}" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ option_label }}">
              {%- for value in option.values -%}
                <button type="button" class="pdp-m__szb{% if is_ship %} pdp-m__chip{% endif %}" role="radio" aria-checked="{% if value == option.selected_value %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-value="{{ value | escape }}">
                  {%- if is_ship -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s7-6.2 7-11.5A7 7 0 0 0 5 9.5C5 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg>{%- endif -%}
                  {{- value | escape -}}
                </button>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </section>
  {%- endunless -%}

  {%- comment -%} 6. Quantité + livraison + bouton : pilotent le champ quantité et le bouton du formulaire du thème. {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pdp-m__card">
    <div class="pdp-m__qrow">
      <div class="pdp-m__qty" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.quantity' | t }}">
        <button type="button" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.less' | t }}" data-pdp-qty="-1">−</button>
        <output data-pdp-qty-value>1</output>
        <button type="button" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.more' | t }}" data-pdp-qty="1">+</button>
      </div>
      <div class="pdp-m__dl"><b>{{ 'mobile.pdp.fast_delivery' | t }}</b><br>{{ 'mobile.pdp.ship_today' | t }} <span class="pdp-m__cd" data-pdp-ship-timer>00:00:00</span></div>
    </div>
    <button class="pdp-m__cta" type="button" data-pdp-add>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 6h15l-1.5 9h-12z"/><path d="M6 6 5 2H2"/><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1.5"/></svg>
      <span data-pdp-cta-text>{{ 'mobile.pdp.add_to_cart' | t }} · {{ pm_price | money }}{{ mm_cur }}</span>
    </button>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} 7. Fidélité : textes repris des apps de points / crédit (Honeypop) une fois affichées. {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pdp-m__card pdp-m__rw" data-pdp-rewards hidden>
    <div class="pdp-m__rwr" data-pdp-points hidden>
      <span class="pdp-m__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="6"/><path d="m8.5 14.5-1.5 6.5 5-2.5 5 2.5-1.5-6.5"/></svg></span>
      <span><b data-pdp-points-text></b><small data-pdp-points-sub>{{ 'mobile.pdp.with_purchase' | t }}</small></span>
    </div>
    <div class="pdp-m__rwr" data-pdp-credit hidden>
      <span class="pdp-m__ic pdp-m__ic--pink"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h13v4"/><path d="M3 7v11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14V9H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><circle cx="16" cy="14.5" r="1.2" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
      <span><b data-pdp-credit-text></b><small>{{ 'mobile.pdp.credit_sub' | t }}</small></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} 8. Protections : chaque case ouvre la feuille « Protections » sur son onglet (snippets/pdp-mobile-protect.liquid). {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pdp-m__card">
    <div class="pdp-m__ctitle"><h3>{{ 'protezioni.header_title' | t: shop_name: shop.name }}</h3></div>
    {%- comment -%} Prototype « Icone » : rangée défilante de raccourcis ronds, libellé sous l'icône. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="pdp-m__prot" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'protezioni.header_title' | t: shop_name: shop.name | escape }}">
      <button type="button" data-pdp-pt-open="pay">
        <span class="pdp-m__prot-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="13" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3 10.5h18M7 15h4"/></svg></span>
        <span class="pdp-m__prot-tx"><b>{{ 'protezioni.cards.pagamenti' | t }}</b></span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-pdp-pt-open="ship">
        <span class="pdp-m__prot-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 8 12 3 3 8v8l9 5 9-5z"/><path d="M3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v8"/></svg></span>
        <span class="pdp-m__prot-tx"><b>{{ 'protezioni.cards.consegna' | t }}</b></span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-pdp-pt-open="ret">
        <span class="pdp-m__prot-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 14 4 9l5-5"/><path d="M4 9h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-3"/></svg></span>
        <span class="pdp-m__prot-tx"><b>{{ 'protezioni.cards.rimborso' | t }}</b></span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-pdp-pt-open="priv">
        <span class="pdp-m__prot-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="10.5" width="14" height="10" rx="2.5"/><path d="M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2.5"/></svg></span>
        <span class="pdp-m__prot-tx"><b>{{ 'protezioni.cards.privacy' | t }}</b></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%}
    9. Garantie commande (prototype « Icone ») : une ligne « Garanzia Ordine · Resi, spedizione e rimborsi › » qui ouvre
    la feuille « Garantie commande » (snippets/pdp-mobile-order.liquid : uniquement des engagements écrits dans les
    politiques de la boutique — reso 30 giorni, garanzia sul prezzo, preparazione, pacco danneggiato, tracking, rimborso).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pdp-m__card pdp-m__gentry">
    <button type="button" data-pdp-pt-sheet="order" data-pdp-pt-open="ret" aria-haspopup="dialog">
      <span class="pdp-m__gentry-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3 4.5 6v6c0 4.5 3.2 7.6 7.5 9 4.3-1.4 7.5-4.5 7.5-9V6z"/><path d="m9 12 2.2 2.2L15.5 10"/></svg></span>
      <span class="pdp-m__gentry-tx"><b>{{ 'mobile.pdp.guarantee_title' | t }}</b><small>{{ 'mobile_pdp_hd.guarantee_sub' | t }}</small></span>
      <svg class="pdp-m__gentry-go" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
    </button>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} 10. Klarna : 3 rate calculées sur le prix réel de la variante. {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pdp-m__kl">
    <i>Klarna</i>
    <p>{%- assign pm_klarna_amount = pm_price | divided_by: 3 | money | append: mm_cur -%}
    <b data-pdp-klarna>{{ 'mobile.pdp.klarna_installments_html' | t: amount: pm_klarna_amount }}</b><br>{{ 'mobile.pdp.klarna_interest' | t }}</p>
    <a href="https://www.klarna.com/it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ 'mobile.pdp.learn_more' | t }}</a>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    11. Description en sections + onglets collants : construite par assets/pdp-mobile.js à partir des vrais titres
    de la description du produit (Panoramica, Caratteristiche, Vantaggi, Tabella delle taglie, Specifiche…) et de ses photos.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if product.description != blank -%}
    <template data-pdp-desc-src>{{ product.description }}</template>
    <div class="pdp-m__desc" data-pdp-desc></div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} 12. Avis : note réelle du produit ; la liste et le formulaire d'avis de l'app (Ali Reviews) sont placés ici par le script. {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pdp-m__sec" id="pdp-reviews">
    {%- comment -%} Fallback sans app d'avis : titre + note Shopify. Le bloc de l'app (résumé, barres, médias, liste) le remplace via le script. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div data-pdp-reviews-fallback>
      <h2>{{ 'mobile.pdp.reviews_title' | t }}</h2>
      <p class="pdp-m__sum-note">{% if pm_rating_count > 0 %}{% assign pm_rating_text = pm_rating | round: 1 %}{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'it' %}{% assign pm_rating_text = pm_rating_text | replace: '.', ',' %}{% endif %}{{ 'mobile.pdp.rating_out_of' | t: rating: pm_rating_text }} · {{ pm_rating_count }} {% if pm_rating_count == 1 %}{{ 'mobile.pdp.review' | t }}{% else %}{{ 'mobile.pdp.reviews' | t }}{% endif %}{% else %}{{ 'mobile.pdp.first_review' | t }}{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    <div data-pdp-reviews-slot></div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%}
    13. Potrebbe piacerti anche, comme SHEIN : puces collées sous l'en-tête = « Consigliati » (recommandations Shopify du
    produit, puis sa catégorie) et les catégories proches dans le menu principal (la catégorie du produit, ses sœurs du
    même groupe, puis les autres groupes du même rayon). Cartes de la page d'accueil (snippets/mshein-card.liquid) en
    2 colonnes décalées, 20 de plus en approchant du bas, sans bouton ; un toucher sur une puce change le fil sur place.
    Pages des catégories : modèle collection.mshein-dept-page ; recommandations : search.mshein-search-page (assets/pdp-mobile.js).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign rl_menu = linklists['main-menu']
    assign rl_handles = product.collections | map: 'handle'
    assign rl_cat = nil
    assign rl_group = nil
    assign rl_top = nil
    for rl_top_link in rl_menu.links
      for rl_level2 in rl_top_link.links
        for rl_level3 in rl_level2.links
          if rl_level3.type == 'collection_link' and rl_handles contains rl_level3.object.handle
            assign rl_cat = rl_level3
            assign rl_group = rl_level2
            assign rl_top = rl_top_link
            break
          endif
        endfor
        if rl_cat != nil
          break
        endif
      endfor
      if rl_cat != nil
        break
      endif
    endfor
    # Sans catégorie de 3e niveau : un groupe (2e niveau) qui contient le produit.
    if rl_cat == nil
      for rl_top_link in rl_menu.links
        for rl_level2 in rl_top_link.links
          if rl_level2.type == 'collection_link' and rl_handles contains rl_level2.object.handle
            assign rl_cat = rl_level2
            assign rl_top = rl_top_link
            break
          endif
        endfor
        if rl_cat != nil
          break
        endif
      endfor
    endif
    assign rl_seen = ','
  -%}
  {%- capture rl_chips -%}
    {%- if rl_cat != nil -%}
      {%- assign rl_seen = rl_seen | append: rl_cat.object.handle | append: ',' -%}
      <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-src="{{ rl_cat.object.url }}?view=mshein-dept-page">{{ rl_cat.title | escape }}</button>
      {%- if rl_group != nil -%}
        {%- for rl_link in rl_group.links -%}
          {%- assign rl_key = ',' | append: rl_link.object.handle | append: ',' -%}
          {%- if rl_link.type != 'collection_link' or rl_link.object == blank or rl_seen contains rl_key or rl_link.object.products_count == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign rl_seen = rl_seen | append: rl_link.object.handle | append: ',' -%}
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-src="{{ rl_link.object.url }}?view=mshein-dept-page">{{ rl_link.title | escape }}</button>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- for rl_link in rl_top.links -%}
        {%- assign rl_key = ',' | append: rl_link.object.handle | append: ',' -%}
        {%- if rl_link.type != 'collection_link' or rl_link.object == blank or rl_seen contains rl_key or rl_link.object.products_count == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if rl_group != nil and rl_link.object.handle == rl_group.object.handle -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign rl_seen = rl_seen | append: rl_link.object.handle | append: ',' -%}
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-src="{{ rl_link.object.url }}?view=mshein-dept-page">{{ rl_link.title | escape }}</button>
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  <section class="pdp-m__rel" id="pdp-related" data-pdp-related data-url="{{ routes.product_recommendations_url }}.json?limit=10&intent=related&product_id={{ product.id }}" data-search="{{ routes.search_url }}" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-handle="{{ product.handle }}"{% if rl_cat != nil %} data-cat="{{ rl_cat.object.url }}?view=mshein-dept-page"{% endif %}>
    <h2>{{ 'mobile.pdp.you_may_like' | t }}</h2>
    <div class="pdp-m__rchips" role="tablist" data-pdp-rchips>
      <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="is-on" data-src="rec">{{ 'mobile.home.recommended' | t }}</button>
      {{- rl_chips -}}
    </div>
    <div class="pdp-m__feed" data-pdp-feed><ul class="pdp-m__fcol"></ul><ul class="pdp-m__fcol"></ul></div>
    <div class="mshein-loader pdp-m__floader" data-pdp-feed-loader hidden aria-label="{{ 'mobile.js.loading' | t }}"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <div class="pdp-m__fsent" data-pdp-feed-sentinel></div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%}
    14. Barre d'achat fixe au style SHEIN (au-dessus de la barre du bas) : cœur de la wishlist du site et bouton foncé
    « -X% DI SCONTO! / AGGIUNGI AL CARRELLO » (réduction de la variante choisie) ; cachée quand le gros bouton est visible.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign buy_off = 0
    if pm_compare > pm_price
      assign buy_off = pm_compare | minus: pm_price | times: 100 | divided_by: pm_compare
    endif
    assign buy_off_template = 'mobile_pdp_hd.buy_off' | t: percent: '__PCT__'
    assign buy_off_text = 'mobile_pdp_hd.buy_off' | t: percent: buy_off
  -%}
  <div class="pdp-m__buy" data-pdp-buy>
    <button class="pdp-m__fav" type="button" data-pdp-fav aria-pressed="false" data-add="{{ 'mobile.js.add_to_wishlist' | t | escape }}" data-remove="{{ 'mobile.js.remove_from_wishlist' | t | escape }}" data-added="{{ 'mobile.js.added_to_wishlist' | t | escape }}" data-removed="{{ 'mobile.js.removed_from_wishlist' | t | escape }}" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-title="{{ product.title | escape }}" data-url="{{ product.url }}" data-image="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.js.add_to_wishlist' | t | escape }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 10c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z"/></svg></button>
    <script>
      /* Cœur rouge dès la première image si le produit est déjà dans la wishlist (même stockage que
         assets/mobile-temu-header.js) ; le toucher est branché ensuite par assets/pdp-mobile.js. */
      (function () {
        var fav = document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;
        try {
          var items = JSON.parse(window.localStorage.getItem('platinumshop:wishlist:v1') || '[]');
          var saved = Array.isArray(items) && items.some(function (item) { return item && String(item.id) === fav.getAttribute('data-product-id'); });
          if (saved) {
            fav.classList.add('is-on');
            fav.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');
            fav.setAttribute('aria-label', fav.getAttribute('data-remove'));
          }
        } catch (error) { /* stockage indisponible : cœur vide */ }
      })();
    </script>
    <button class="pdp-m__go" type="button" data-pdp-add>
      <small data-pdp-buy-off data-template="{{ buy_off_template | escape }}"{% if buy_off < 1 %} hidden{% endif %}><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 17 9 11l4 4 8-8"/></svg><span>{{ buy_off_text }}</span></small>
      <b>{{ 'mobile.pdp.add_to_cart' | t }}</b>
    </button>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Visionneuse des photos de la description. {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pdp-m__lb" data-pdp-lightbox role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.desc_photos' | t }}" hidden>
    <button class="pdp-m__lbx" type="button" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.close' | t }}" data-pdp-lb-close><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button>
    <span class="pdp-m__lbc" data-pdp-lb-count>1 / 1</span>
    <div class="pdp-m__lbs" data-pdp-lb-slides></div>
    <button class="pdp-m__lbp" type="button" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.previous' | t }}" data-pdp-lb-step="-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 5-7 7 7 7"/></svg></button>
    <button class="pdp-m__lbn" type="button" aria-label="{{ 'mobile.pdp.next' | t }}" data-pdp-lb-step="1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
  </div>
</div>
